		ContentEN = "\"This Lantern carries a divine blessing.\"\n\"Restore it with enough <H>Pure Glazeystal</>, and it shall part the depths of the Abyss, opening a path before you.\"\n\"Should you face mortal peril... turn the dial in <H>reverse</>.\"",
