	["1E129462"] = {
		Content = "物竞天择，适者生存，自然界本是如此。为什么人类却满口仁义道德，以弱者自居，以顺服为荣呢？",
		ContentEN = "Survival of the fittest — that is the law of nature. So why do humans take no shame in weakness and elevate submission as if it were some noble virtue?",
