	["1E31CD2E"] = {
		Content = "如果对面是狴犴，飘零人可以去争，可以去反抗。但当面对的是一种看不见摸不着的“大众偏见”的时候，那些激进的手段反而适得其反。",
		ContentEN = "If it were the Bi'an, we could fight it. But when it's something you can't see or grab... something like prejudice, pushing too hard just makes it worse.",
