		Content = "每当遇到这种事情，我都只能尽可能去斥责那些黑心的店主，再想办法帮那些卡戎洗脱冤屈，报酬大多也讨不回来。",
		ContentEN = "Every time I came across these cases, all I could do was reprimand the unscrupulous shopkeepers and try my best to help those Charons clear their names. Most of the time, I couldn't even recover their wages.",
