		Content = "（穿越遍布尸骸的路，我听到自己沉重的喘息，摸到自己的心跳。我从未感觉过自己如此渺小。）",
		ContentEN = "As I moved through the path strewn with corpses, I could hear my own ragged breath.\nFeel the thud of my own heartbeat. Never had I felt so small.",
